SQLarius: Good. That’s the expected behavior for a standard category search.

SQLarius: Now we can take this a step further.
SQLarius: The search box accepts more than just simple categories.

SQLarius: With a UNION command, you can attach additional results to the original query.
SQLarius: This includes categories the system normally hides.

SQLarius: When you’re ready, try using UNION to reveal a hidden category. 
SQLarius: If you need help, use the hint button.
[end_timeline]
